CLEANERS-APP(1)             General Commands Manual            CLEANERS-APP(1)

NAME
       cleaners-app - Professional cleaning service management system

SYNOPSIS
       cleaners-app [OPTIONS]
       cleaners-demo [OPTIONS]

DESCRIPTION
       cleaners-app is a comprehensive cleaning service management system that handles
       customer transactions, employee management, and business analytics. The system
       provides both production and demo modes for different use cases.

MODES OF OPERATION

   Production Mode (cleaners-app)
       The standard production interface for running a cleaning service business.
       Handles real customer data, transactions, and employee management.

       Usage:
           ./cleaners-app
           python3 main.py

   Demo Mode (cleaners-demo)  
       Interactive testing environment with fake data generation and database
       statistics. Perfect for testing, training, and demonstrations.

       Usage:
           ./cleaners-demo
           python3 demo.py

OPTIONS
       --help, -h
           Show this help message and exit.

       --version, -v  
           Show version information and exit.

       --license
           Display license information and exit.

       --demo-stats
           Quick access to database statistics without interactive menu.
           Only available in demo mode.

       --generate-data [COUNT]
           Generate fake data for testing. Optional COUNT specifies number of
           customers to generate (default: 10). Only available in demo mode.

DATABASE
       The application uses SQLite database stored as ./business_data.db in the
       current working directory. The database is automatically created on first
       run with the following schema:

       Tables:
           customers (id, name, address, amount_paid, discount)
           employees (id, name, address, region, badge_id)

FILES
       ./business_data.db
           Default SQLite database file.

       ./main.py
           Production mode entry point.

       ./demo.py
           Demo mode entry point.

       ./requirements.txt
           Python dependencies list.

       ./venv/
           Virtual environment directory.

SECURITY
       The application uses parameterized SQL queries to prevent SQL injection
       attacks. All user input is validated and sanitized. Database operations
       follow secure coding practices.

EXAMPLES
       Run production application:
           $ ./cleaners-app

       Run demo with interactive menu:
           $ ./cleaners-demo

       Generate fake data for testing:
           $ ./cleaners-demo --generate-data 25

       View database statistics:
           $ ./cleaners-demo --demo-stats

       Show version information:
           $ ./cleaners-app --version

DEPENDENCIES
       Python 3.8+
       rich>=13.0.0
       faker>=40.0.0 (demo mode only)

